+<body>
+<header class="wrap nav"><a class="brand" href="index.html" aria-label="Relay home"><span class="logo" aria-hidden="true">r</span>relay</a><nav class="navlinks" aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="#plans">Plans</a><a href="#compare">Compare</a><a href="#faq">FAQ</a><a class="navcta" href="#plans">Get started</a></nav></header>
+<main class="wrap"><section class="hero" aria-labelledby="page-title"><span class="eyebrow"><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>Less noise. Better work.</span><h1 id="page-title">A plan for your<br>kind of teamwork.</h1><p>Good conversations deserve a home. Pick the plan that fits your team today—and grow whenever you’re ready.</p><div class="billing"><span id="monthly-label">Monthly</span><button class="switch" type="button" role="switch" aria-checked="false" aria-label="Use yearly billing" aria-describedby="saving"><span class="knob"></span></button><span id="yearly-label">Yearly</span><span class="save" id="saving">Save 20%</span></div></section>
+<section class="plans" id="plans" aria-label="Pricing plans"><article class="card"><h2>Free</h2><p class="desc">A calmer way to start working together.</p><div class="price"><span class="amount" data-month="0" data-year="0">$0</span></div><div class="billing-note">forever, for your whole team</div><ul class="features"><li>Up to 10 members</li><li>Unlimited messages</li><li>3 months of message history</li><li>1:1 audio and video calls</li></ul><a class="button" href="mailto:hello@relay.example?subject=Relay%20Free">Get started free</a></article>
+<article class="card featured"><span class="badge">Most popular</span><h2>Team</h2><p class="desc">Everything you need to stay in sync.</p><div class="price"><span class="amount" data-month="8" data-year="6.4">$8</span><span class="unit">/ user / month</span></div><div class="billing-note" data-note="Billed monthly">Billed monthly</div><ul class="features"><li>Unlimited members and messages</li><li>Unlimited searchable history</li><li>Group audio and video calls</li><li>Guest access and integrations</li><li>Priority support</li></ul><a class="button" href="mailto:hello@relay.example?subject=Relay%20Team">Choose Team</a></article>
+<article class="card"><h2>Business</h2><p class="desc">More control for teams scaling up.</p><div class="price"><span class="amount" data-month="15" data-year="12">$15</span><span class="unit">/ user / month</span></div><div class="billing-note" data-note="Billed monthly">Billed monthly</div><ul class="features"><li>Everything in Team</li><li>Advanced admin and permissions</li><li>SSO and user provisioning</li><li>Data retention controls</li><li>Dedicated support</li></ul><a class="button" href="mailto:hello@relay.example?subject=Relay%20Business">Choose Business</a></article></section>
+<section class="section" id="compare" aria-labelledby="compare-title"><div class="section-heading"><span class="eyebrow">At a glance</span><h2 id="compare-title">Compare plans</h2><p>The details that make the difference.</p></div><div class="table-wrap" role="region" aria-label="Plan feature comparison" tabindex="0"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Feature</th><th scope="col">Free</th><th scope="col">Team</th><th scope="col">Business</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Members</td><td>Up to 10</td><td>Unlimited</td><td>Unlimited</td></tr><tr><td>Message history</td><td>90 days</td><td>Unlimited</td><td>Unlimited</td></tr><tr><td>Audio &amp; video calls</td><td>1:1</td><td>Group</td><td>Group</td></tr><tr><td>Integrations</td><td>5</td><td>Unlimited</td><td>Unlimited</td></tr><tr><td>Guest access</td><td><span class="no" aria-label="Not included">—</span></td><td><span class="check" aria-label="Included">✓</span></td><td><span class="check" aria-label="Included">✓</span></td></tr><tr><td>Advanced admin &amp; SSO</td><td><span class="no" aria-label="Not included">—</span></td><td><span class="no" aria-label="Not included">—</span></td><td><span class="check" aria-label="Included">✓</span></td></tr><tr><td>Support</td><td>Community</td><td>Priority</td><td>Dedicated</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
+<section class="section faq" id="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-title"><div class="section-heading"><span class="eyebrow">Good to know</span><h2 id="faq-title">Frequently asked questions</h2></div><details><summary>Can I try Relay before paying?</summary><p>Absolutely. The Free plan is free forever, and you can explore Relay with your team without entering payment details.</p></details><details><summary>How does yearly billing work?</summary><p>Choose yearly billing to save 20% per user. The displayed monthly equivalent is billed annually; you can switch back to monthly at any time before your next renewal.</p></details><details><summary>Can I change plans later?</summary><p>Yes. Upgrade or downgrade whenever your team’s needs change. Your messages and workspace stay with you.</p></details><details><summary>What happens when my team grows?</summary><p>Invite everyone you need on Team or Business. Free supports up to 10 members, and upgrading takes just a moment.</p></details><details><summary>Do you offer help moving our team to Relay?</summary><p>We’d love to help. Business customers get dedicated support, and any team can reach us at hello@relay.example.</p></details></section>
+</main><footer class="wrap footer"><span>© 2025 Relay. Made for teams that care.</span><a href="mailto:hello@relay.example">Questions? Talk to us</a></footer>
+<script>
+(()=>{const toggle=document.querySelector('.switch');const amounts=document.querySelectorAll('.amount');const notes=document.querySelectorAll('.billing-note[data-note]');const monthly=document.getElementById('monthly-label'),yearly=document.getElementById('yearly-label');toggle.addEventListener('click',()=>{const annual=toggle.getAttribute('aria-checked')!=='true';toggle.setAttribute('aria-checked',String(annual));toggle.setAttribute('aria-label',annual?'Use monthly billing':'Use yearly billing');amounts.forEach(el=>{const value=annual?el.dataset.year:el.dataset.month;el.textContent='$'+(Number(value)%1?Number(value).toFixed(2).replace(/0$/,''):value)});notes.forEach(el=>el.textContent=annual?'Billed annually':'Billed monthly');monthly.setAttribute('aria-current',annual?'false':'true');yearly.setAttribute('aria-current',annual?'true':'false')})})();
+</script>
